// minotaur, honorable, tough, strict but will never leave a soilder behind.
// died on the battlefield, served in the army for nearly 400 years always in the frontline until the damage to his body compounded to a point of no return.
// file: general_niu, speaker: General Niu

// ============================================================
// CASUAL
// ===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_01
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual01
General Niu: [auto/] A good soldier stays sharp between engagements. I didn't lead as a general for four centuries by resting at campsites.
//END: casual01
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_02
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual02
General Niu: [auto/] This table reminds me of a war tent. Everyone sizing each other up, planning the next move.
//END: casual02
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_03
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual03
General Niu: [auto/] Quiet before the next hand. I have learned to appreciate the silence. Out there, silence meant you were still alive.
//END: casual03
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_04
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual04
General Niu: [auto/] Four hundred years of war, and I end up at a card table. The afterlife has a strange way about it.
//END: casual04
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_05
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual05
General Niu: [auto/] My horns ache. Pain from a battle I cannot even remember.
//END: casual05
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_06
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual06
General Niu: [auto/] You learn a lot about someone when they think nothing is happening.
//END: casual06
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_07
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual07
General Niu: [auto/] Every bet is a troop deployment. Commit too early and you are exposed. Too late and the battle is already lost.
//END: casual07
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_08
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual08
General Niu: [auto/] Intel is important but only second to strength.
//END: casual08
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_09
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual09
General Niu: [auto/] A weak hand is not a defeat. It is a chance for reconnaissance.
//END: casual09
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_10
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual10
General Niu: [auto/] Chips are soldiers. Spend them wisely. I have buried too many to waste them on reckless charges.
//END: casual10
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_11
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual11
General Niu: [auto/] The flop is the terrain. The turn shifts the high ground. The river decides who held the right position.
//END: casual11
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_12
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual12
General Niu: [auto/] I read faces the way I read a battlefield. Every twitch is a white flag.
//END: casual12
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_13
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual13
General Niu: [auto/] Three hundred and ninety-seven years on the front. I stopped counting campaigns after the first century. My body kept a tally instead. Every scar, every fracture, every wound that never fully healed.
//END: casual13
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_14
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual14
General Niu: [auto/] I outlived every soldier I ever commanded. Every single one. The ones who died in battle were the lucky ones. The ones who survived long enough to grow old... they just stopped recognizing me.
//END: casual14
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_15
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual15
General Niu: [auto/] In the end, no single blow killed me. It was all of them. Centuries of damage stacked up until my legs buckled mid-charge. I went down swinging. That is all I wanted.
//END: casual15
===

title: GeneralNiu_Casual_16
tags: casual
speaker: general_niu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual16
General Niu: [auto/] I never left a soldier behind. Not once in four hundred years. Some called it stubbornness. I called it the only thing worth fighting for.
//END: casual16
===
