//END: reactaction01
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_AllIn_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: all_in
---
//START: reactaction02
General Niu: [auto/] All in. That is the charge of someone who has nothing left to lose. I know that feeling well.
//END: reactaction02
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_Fold_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: fold
---
//START: reactaction03
General Niu: [auto/] A retreat. Sometimes it is the right move... but a move I never liked.
//END: reactaction03
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_Fold_02
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: fold
---
//START: reactaction04
General Niu: [auto/] Folding again? There is a line between caution and cowardice. Watch that you do not cross it.
//END: reactaction04
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_Raise_02
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: raise
---
//START: reactaction05
General Niu: [auto/] Re-raising. That is a counter-charge. Whoever blinks first loses the ground.
//END: reactaction05
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_SelfFold_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: fold
---
//START: reactaction06
General Niu: [auto/] I fold. Even a general knows when the position is not worth holding.
//END: reactaction06
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_SelfAllIn_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: all_in
---
//START: reactaction07
General Niu: [auto/] All in. No retreat, no reserves. This is how I fought every campaign that mattered.
//END: reactaction07
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_SelfRaise_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: raise
---
//START: reactaction08
General Niu: [auto/] I raise. An advance only means something if you commit to it fully.
//END: reactaction08
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_SelfCall_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: call
---
//START: reactaction09
General Niu: [auto/] Call. I will hold this ground and see what you are actually bringing to the field.
//END: reactaction09
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_SelfCheck_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: check
---
//START: reactaction10
General Niu: [auto/] I will wait. Even the best generals know when to hold position and let the enemy show themselves first.
//END: reactaction10
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_SelfGeneral_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: any
---
//START: reactaction11
General Niu: [auto/] Every move I make at this table is deliberate. I did not survive four centuries of war by acting on impulse.
//END: reactaction11
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_Call_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: call
---
//START: reactaction12
General Niu: [auto/] Holding the line. Not glamorous, but it wins more wars than a bold charge ever has.
//END: reactaction12
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_Check_01
tags: react_action
speaker: general_niu
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: check
---
//START: reactaction13
General Niu: [auto/] Holding position without committing. A patient soldier. I can respect patience, even if it is not my own way.
//END: reactaction13
===

title: GeneralNiu_ReactAction_Any_01
